  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Zanzibar Legal Services Centre (ZLSC) 2013-2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zanzibar Legal Services Centre (ZLSC) Core support for Strategic plan 2013-2017 - Zanzibar Legal Services Centre (ZLSC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Zanzibar Legal Services Centre (ZLSC) during 2013-2017. Sweden is the lead donor and has supported ZLSC for some   10 years. Main focus of the Centre&apos;s work is to providing legal aid   for women and men living in poverty, and documentation and            awareness-raising on the human rights situation in Zanzibar (Pemba    and Unguja).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till ZLSC f&#xf6;r deras strategiska plan 2013-2017. Svenskt st&#xf6;d har getts under drygt 10 &#xe5;r, och Sverige &#xe4;r ledande  givare. Huvudinriktningen &#xe4;r r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp &#xe5;t fattiga kvinnor och m&#xe4;n,   samt dokumentation och kunskapsspridning om situationen f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
